# The SEO automation layer is not part of going live.
#
# api/ holds the Ghost webhook receiver and the report endpoints. They need
# GHOST_WEBHOOK_SECRET, GEMINI_API_KEY, SEO_WORKER_TOKEN, VERCEL_DEPLOY_HOOK_URL
# and Upstash credentials, none of which are configured yet - so deploying them
# adds failure surface for no current benefit.
#
# The blog itself is entirely static and needs none of it.
#
# To enable the automation layer later: delete this file, set those five
# variables, and configure the four Ghost webhooks (see specs/03-seo-automation.md).
api/

# Never needed at build time.
specs/
tickets/
infra/
